* OPA_QUAD = 4 x TI TLV9062 PSpice macro (SBOMAG1E Rev D; downloaded at run time, not committed) + 2 pF pad on each in+.
* Needs 'set ngbehavior=psa'.  OP of >~16 macros does not converge in reasonable time in ngspice 42 (measured, docs/circuit_extraction.md),
* so the full-tile .tran uses opa_quad_fit.lib; this one is used for the one-channel slice cross-check.
.subckt OPA_QUAD in1p in1n out1 vcc in2p in2n out2 in3p in3n out3 in4p in4n out4 vee
X1 in1p in1n vcc vee out1 TLV9062
X2 in2p in2n vcc vee out2 TLV9062
X3 in3p in3n vcc vee out3 TLV9062
X4 in4p in4n vcc vee out4 TLV9062
Cp1 in1p vee 2p
Cp2 in2p vee 2p
Cp3 in3p vee 2p
Cp4 in4p vee 2p
.ends OPA_QUAD
